{"sourceUrl":"https://ysxy.chd.edu.cn/2025/0905/c6228a254411/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T17:01:46.175050+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://ysxy.chd.edu.cn/2025/0905/c6228a254411/page.htm","html":"<div><p><span><span>长安大学运输工程学院</span><span>202</span></span><span>6</span><span>年接收推荐免试硕士研究生预报名工作已开启，欢迎全国各校优秀学子踊跃报名。</span></p><p><strong><span>  一、申请条件</span></strong></p><p><span><span>  1.</span><span>中华人民共和国公民，拥护中国共产党的领导，遵纪守法，品德良好；</span></span></p><p><span><span>  2.2026</span><span>届普通全日制本科毕业生，有望取得本科所在学校的推荐免试生资格；</span></span></p><p><span><span>  3.</span><span>研究兴趣浓厚，有较强的创新意识、创新能力和专业能力；</span></span></p><p><span><span>  4.</span><span>身体健康状况符合国家规定的体检要求</span></span><span>。</span></p><p><strong><span> 二、招生专业</span><span> </span></strong><span> </span></p><p><span></span></p><p><span>‍</span></p><table><tbody><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><strong><span>专业名称</span></strong></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><strong><span>研究方向</span></strong></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>学硕——交通运输工程082300</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>01交通工程  02交通运输规划与管理</span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>专硕——交通运输086100</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>不区分研究方向</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>学硕——统计学071400</span></p></td><td><p><span>不区分</span><span>研究方向</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>学博——交通运输</span><span>规划与管理</span><span>082303（本科直博）</span></p></td><td><p><span>不区分</span><span>研究方向</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><br/></p><p><span><span>（最终以我校</span><span>2026</span><span>年研究生招生目录为准）</span></span></p><p><strong><span>  三、申请流程</span></strong></p><p><span><span>  申请人可于</span><span>8</span><span>月</span><span>11</span><span>日起登录长安大学推免生预报名系统（</span><span>http://49.233.141.142/xly/login</span><span>），填写有关信息、上传附件材料并提交申请。</span></span></p><p><span><span></span></span></p><p><span><span>申请人将以下材料按照</span><span>顺序整理成一个</span><span>PDF</span><span>文件（不超过</span><span>10M</span><span>），上传推免生预报名系统。</span></span></p><p><span>1</span><span>．个人简历、身份证和学生证；</span></p><p><span>2</span><span>．本科成绩单和总评成绩排名证明（由教务处盖章或所在学院盖章）；</span></p><p><span>3</span><span><span>．英语水平证明材料（</span><span>CET-4</span><span>、</span><span>CET-6</span><span>、</span><span>TOEFL</span><span>、</span><span>IELTS</span><span>等成绩单）；</span></span></p><p><span>4</span><span>．学术科研成果（公开发表的学术论文、专利等）和获奖证书；</span></p><p><span>5</span><span>．参加社会实践、公益事业等的证明材料；</span></p><p><span>6</span><span><span>．申请直博生的学生还须提供两名所报考学科专业领域内教授（或相当专业技术职称的专家）的推荐信（附件</span><span>1</span><span>）和专家的职称证书复印件。直博生报名必须有导师接收。</span></span></p><p><strong><span>  四、联系方式</span></strong></p><p><span>  申请人请</span><span>加入</span><span><span>长安大学运输工程学院</span><span>2026</span><span>年硕士研究生招生工作群（</span></span><span><span>QQ</span><span>群</span></span><span>号：</span><span><span>750593497</span><span>），备注“姓名</span><span>-</span><span>专业</span><span>-</span><span>学校”，后续安排会在</span><span>QQ</span><span>群里通知。</span></span></p><p><strong><span>  五、其他事项</span></strong></p><p><span><span>  其他未尽事宜以长安大学</span><span>2026</span><span>年接收推荐免试研究生（含直博生）预报名通知</span></span><span>（</span><span>https://yzb.chd.edu.cn/2025/0809/c2769a254078/page.htm</span><span>）</span><span>为准。</span></p><p><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://ysxy.chd.edu.cn/_ueditor/themes/default/images/icon_doc.gif\"/><a href=\"https://ysxy.chd.edu.cn/_upload/article/files/75/a2/65d169c845adb01db77d3d275a4d/983d5076-d052-450a-854e-b69bd6e829e0.docx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件1-2026年招收攻读博士学位研究生专家推荐书.docx</a></span></p><p><br/></p><p><span>运输工程学院</span></p><p><span><span>2025</span><span>年</span><span>8</span><span>月</span></span><span>15</span><span>日</span></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p></div>","textSha256":"12c785db47a123300f464f0461531c722697db610dc7d6ed3030eb5136907516","textLength":881,"sourceSha256":"be997d64a11914ecaf2cf8314561cacef51b6856bacd3adcb1408d87299ab5eb","selector":".wp_articlecontent","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-b8a740165382c2c63807","title":"2025年长安大学运输工程学院2026年接收推荐免试研究生（含直博生）预报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T17:01:46.175050+00:00"}
